    "title": "Almont Township Board Regular Meeting Synopsis November 10, 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Guest ,\n1 days ago Meeting called to order by Supervisor Groesbeck at 7:00 p.m. at 819 N. Main Street, Almont, MI. Members present were Supervisor Groesbeck, Clerk Henige, Treasurer Streeter, and Trustees Chriss, Dodge, Eschenburg, and Sweers. The following actions were taken: 1.) approved consent agenda 2.) approved Planning Commission appointment 3.) approved ZBA alternate appointment, 4.) approved Deputy Treasurer appointment, 5.) approved Park Board appointment, 6.) approved snow contract for Fire Hall 2025/2026, 7.) approved Positive Pay Procedures Policy and Resolution, 8.) approved Private Road Policy. Meeting adjourned at 8:23 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
